# Evidence

- Apply `governance/10-evidence-standard.md`.
- Link each evidence item to an AC or NFR from the exact Pack version.
- Record method, result, immutable link, environment/time and limitations.
- Never convert planned, missing, partial or stale evidence into `pass`.
- Make coverage gaps and residual risk explicit.
